   1001  f70b							; Feature-record dispatch ($80 phase / $81 vcrunch / $82 hcrunch — Phase 4):
   1002  f70b							; armed/overlap/kill tests live in bank3 (HOVFeatEntry). $80 phase: b5 armed
   1003  f70b							; (staged by PhaseBlink each VBL) + candidate-box overlap → shared Hot hit
   1004  f70b							; (Temp b7 → bank0 `jsr LoseLife`); kill gated on armed-and-not-removed
   1005  f70b							; (`and #$60 / cmp #$20`), latches b6, PhaseBlink punch forced OFF while b6
   1006  f70b							; set (walls REMOVED, same-room only — EnterRoom zeroes the mask).
   1007  f70b							; $81 vcrunch: sprite shutter — the kill rides the OverlayTramp MISS path
   1008  f70b							; (OvShutTest/OvShutBand, MetaB b7 gate) because the punched cell never
   1009  f70b							; trips this walk. The record path (loop push + HOVFeatPre's 4 field pushes
   1010  f70b							; + bank3 jsr HOVvcrunch) measured SP=$F6 = real BombTimer ($F7) stomp
   1011  f70b							; (sim_bomb_fuse mirror stomp, 2026-10-13) — skip the record here.
   1012  f70b							; Entered with Y = record base + pushed Y (loop invariant), A = mask.
   1013  f70b							; 15B kept: the cmp/beq/jmp + pad replace the old tramp byte-for-byte —
   1014  f70b							; the BombEnemyBlastBody $FD87 pin (kernel tramp operand) must not move.
   1015  f70b				   .HOVfeature
   1016  f70b		       c9 81		      cmp	#$81
   1017  f70d		       f0 ef		      beq	HOVnext	; vcrunch skip (HOVnext pops the loop Y)
   1018  f70f							; LineCount is clobbered by the kernel .Row between this VBL staging and
   1019  f70f							; the overscan walk, so the hot byte (MetaB b6) is re-staged HERE, at the
   1020  f70f							; call, exactly like the old bank2 pre-read did.
   1021  f70f		       a5 9a		      lda	RoomMetaB
   1022  f711		       85 84		      sta	LineCount
   1023  f713		       b1 e5		      lda	(FetchPtr),Y	; restore the class (Y = record base)
   1024  f715		       4c 40 fa 	      jmp	HOVFeatEntry	; A3b: same-bank, fields read from FetchPtr
   1025  f718		       00 00 00 00*	      .ds	8, 0	; pad: 2+2+3+8 = 15B = old body size
   1026  f720
