   1028  f720
   1029  f720
   1030  f720							; A3b (2026-10-19): HOVFeatPre / PhHcrPre DELETED. Both bodies are in
   1031  f720							; this bank now, so the feature dispatchers read the record fields
   1032  f720							; straight from FetchPtr with Y = record base — no 4-field stack
   1033  f720							; shuttle (the stack floor improves by ~7 bytes on both paths).
   1034  f720
   1035  f720							; ==============================================================================
   1036  f720							; PhVcrEntry — PhaseBlink $81 (vcrunch) tramp target.
   1037  f720							; Record: $81, x (4px col), y (row), w (4px), h (rows). The covered TOP
   1038  f720							; rows of the bbox keep/set their pair bits (shutter closed), the open
   1039  f720							; rows clear them (shutter retracted). covered_h = CrunchClock(h) —
   1040  f720							; ping-pong with a dwell at the home stub (always ≥1 row: never gone,
   1041  f720							; user ruling 2026-10-13). Y = record class on entry; tail leaves
   1042  f720							; Y = base+2 for PhNext. Clobbers A/X/Y + LineCount/CCX/CEY.
