   1052  f720							; PhHcrEntry — PhaseBlink $82 (hcrunch) tramp target.
   1053  f720							; Record: $82, 0, band (row), w (4px = 2*cells), 1. Single-row band
   1054  f720							; prefix from col 0: cells 0..n-1 covered (n = HcrClock(full)), the
   1055  f720							; rest of the full bbox cleared. PF = (row & ~P(full)) | P(n) — fused in
   1056  f720							; ONE pass (P(n) ⊆ P(full), so AND-then-OR collapses; one pass halves the
   1057  f720							; buffer reads). Y = class on entry; tail leaves Y = base+2. Clobbers
   1058  f720							; A/X/Y + LineCount/CCX/CEY.
   1059  f720							; ==============================================================================
